WEBVTT

00:53.377 --> 00:56.957
Every so often when I wake up in the morning,

00:57.957 --> 01:00.477
I find myself crying.

01:01.677 --> 01:05.027
I can never remember the dream I must have had.

01:05.977 --> 01:06.727
But...

01:07.607 --> 01:08.277
But...

01:08.547 --> 01:12.037
The sensation that I've lost something

01:12.077 --> 01:14.577
lingers for a long time after I wake up.

01:23.427 --> 01:24.757
I'm always searching.

01:25.707 --> 01:27.657
For something, or someone.

01:28.407 --> 01:31.077
This feeling has possessed me.

01:31.407 --> 01:33.027
I think from that day...

01:34.557 --> 01:35.407
That day...

01:36.257 --> 01:37.457
That day when the stars came falling.

01:38.307 --> 01:39.507
It was almost as if...

01:39.857 --> 01:42.607
as if a scene from a dream.

01:43.107 --> 01:44.257
Nothing more, nothing less

01:46.127 --> 01:48.507
than a beautiful view.

01:48.967 --> 01:50.967
{Dream Lantern}

01:48.967 --> 01:52.937
Ah, if only our voices speak at night

01:54.357 --> 01:59.827
Could ever reach the very edge of this world, and the time

01:59.827 --> 02:04.137
Instead of fading into air and dust

02:04.777 --> 02:10.447
Then what will the words could ever be? 
Farthest words from 'probably'

02:10.447 --> 02:13.177
Let's make a promise, that will never fade

02:13.177 --> 02:16.827
Let's say it together in count of three, oh

02:27.567 --> 02:30.757
Ah, I'm told that some part of every wish will be heard

02:30.757 --> 02:33.457
But lately I lost sight of the truth in those words

02:33.457 --> 02:38.377
I can't even remember when I gave up believing.
What could have been the reason?

02:38.377 --> 02:41.587
Ah, the very moment that the rain will stop

02:41.587 --> 02:44.257
And the place rainbow born and dies

02:44.257 --> 02:46.277
And where the end of this life lies

02:46.277 --> 02:50.087
I've always been insisting that there was something I've been longing for

02:54.567 --> 02:59.767
One day we'll reach to emotions unexplored unprecedented

02:59.767 --> 03:04.467
We'll high five love we've yet to discover and give a kiss to time

03:04.467 --> 03:07.117
The five dimensions keep on teasing me

03:07.117 --> 03:10.427
But I will keep on looking at you, dear

03:10.427 --> 03:14.217
Let's make a sign for when we say "nice to meet you" again

03:16.107 --> 03:20.597
I'm on my way to you, chasing after your name

03:20.597 --> 03:22.597
{}

03:45.677 --> 03:46.747
Taki-kun.

03:47.887 --> 03:48.897
Taki-kun.

03:50.567 --> 03:52.277
Don't you remember me?

03:54.967 --> 03:55.767
My name is...

03:58.067 --> 03:59.047
Mitsuha!

04:35.267 --> 04:37.207
Onee-chan, what are you doing?

04:37.507 --> 04:40.847
Well, it feels incredibly realistic...

04:42.037 --> 04:43.877
What? "Onee-chan?"

04:44.047 --> 04:45.617
Are you half asleep?

04:45.767 --> 04:46.807
Breakfast!

04:47.407 --> 04:48.147
Hurry up!{sliding door clip}

04:48.147 --> 04:48.227
Hurry up!{sliding door clip}

05:19.927 --> 05:22.407
Grandma, do you want last night's leftovers?

05:22.517 --> 05:23.847
You can have it.

05:24.447 --> 05:26.177
Morning.

05:25.137 --> 05:26.197
Morning.

05:26.207 --> 05:28.607
Onee-chan, you're late!

05:27.827 --> 05:29.797
I'll make breakfast tomorrow.

05:35.857 --> 05:36.917
Is this too much?

05:37.207 --> 05:37.907
Oh well.

05:38.967 --> 05:40.197
You're back to normal.

05:41.077 --> 05:42.677
You were nuts yesterday.

05:43.077 --> 05:44.817
Wait, what?

05:47.027 --> 05:50.047
Good morning, everyone.

05:51.077 --> 05:54.997
Here are the morning announcements from Itomori Town Hall.

05:55.907 --> 05:58.967
For the upcoming mayoral election,

05:59.007 --> 06:03.347
to be held on the 20th next month,
the election committee–

06:06.967 --> 06:09.607
We're now just a month away from a visit by a comet

06:10.257 --> 06:12.097
that appears only once every 1,200 years.

06:12.847 --> 06:17.047
The comet will be visible to the naked eye for several days.

06:17.137 --> 06:19.107
Ain't it time to make up with him?

06:17.527 --> 06:19.047
Research agencies around the world,

06:19.137 --> 06:24.947
including JAXA, are preparing to observe the celestial show of the century.

06:19.187 --> 06:20.467
It's an adult problem.

