06:41.537 --> 06:42.547
We're going now!

06:46.527 --> 06:49.367
And then Gran and the guy at the rice shop...

07:03.447 --> 07:05.047
Study hard!

07:10.737 --> 07:11.797
Mitsuha!

07:12.257 --> 07:14.247
Morning, Saya-chin, Tessie.

07:14.287 --> 07:14.977
Morning.

07:15.207 --> 07:16.497
Hurry up and get off.

07:16.517 --> 07:18.197
Why? Meanie.

07:18.227 --> 07:19.937
C'mon, you're heavy.

07:19.087 --> 07:19.947
Stop being rude.

07:19.947 --> 07:22.217
You two get along so well.

07:22.257 --> 07:23.367
We do not!

07:26.047 --> 07:28.447
Mitsuha, your hair looks all right today.

07:28.787 --> 07:29.667
What?

07:29.717 --> 07:32.787
Yeah, did your grandma exorcise you?

07:32.917 --> 07:33.587
Exorcise?

07:33.617 --> 07:35.397
You were totally possessed.

07:35.907 --> 07:37.967
Cut out the occultism.

07:38.277 --> 07:41.087
Mitsuha is just stressed. Right?

07:41.447 --> 07:43.697
W-Wait. What are you talking about?

07:43.907 --> 07:44.897
You don't remember?

07:46.737 --> 07:48.117
And above all,

07:48.607 --> 07:53.717
restoring the town's fiscal health
to continue its revitalization project!

07:54.207 --> 07:56.067
Only when these are achieved

07:56.227 --> 07:59.237
can a safe and secure community
be created!

08:00.017 --> 08:01.137
As the incumbent mayor,

08:02.327 --> 08:05.087
What's the point? He'll be re-elected anyway.

08:05.127 --> 08:07.667
I heard he's been dishing out the pork.

08:08.147 --> 08:09.267
Hey, Miyamizu.

08:09.697 --> 08:10.627
Morning.

08:11.647 --> 08:14.687
So the mayor's kid and
his contractor's kid get along too.

08:14.767 --> 08:15.667
Ew.

08:16.117 --> 08:18.547
...and enjoy fulfilling, active lives.

