16:44.287 --> 16:46.417
No! That's against the liquor laws.

16:48.547 --> 16:49.797
That's the problem?

16:56.197 --> 16:58.387
I hate this town!

16:58.737 --> 17:01.007
I hate this life!

17:01.187 --> 17:05.237
Please make me a handsome Tokyo boy in my next life!

17:09.697 --> 17:11.297
What an idiot...

17:22.477 --> 17:26.477
m 1692 640 l 1980 776 1920 832 1644 694

17:22.477 --> 17:26.477
Alarm

17:22.477 --> 17:26.477
Alarm

17:22.477 --> 17:26.477
Alarm

17:39.507 --> 17:39.927
Ow!

17:43.297 --> 17:44.757
Ouch...

17:53.887 --> 17:54.517
Where...

18:06.467 --> 18:08.277
Something's down there...

18:22.627 --> 18:23.007
Ow!

18:23.777 --> 18:25.457
Taki! Are you up?

18:27.857 --> 18:29.967
It was your turn to cook.

18:30.047 --> 18:31.237
Wake up on time.

18:31.287 --> 18:32.417
I'm sorry.

18:33.967 --> 18:35.377
I'm heading out.

18:35.557 --> 18:36.977
Finish off the miso soup.

18:37.747 --> 18:38.327
Okay.

18:38.967 --> 18:41.777
Go to school even if you're late. See you.

18:43.537 --> 18:44.547
Have a nice day.

18:56.247 --> 18:57.137
What a strange dream.

