19:03.107 --> 19:07.317
What? Who's it from? Tsukasa? Who's that?

19:17.367 --> 19:18.577
I have to use the bathroom.

19:28.037 --> 19:29.297
This is too real.

20:20.267 --> 20:22.097
Shinjuku Station

20:40.817 --> 20:42.647
I'm in Tokyo!

20:48.107 --> 20:49.627
Jingu 
High School

20:49.927 --> 20:51.407
Where'd you get it?

20:51.187 --> 20:52.207
Daikayama.

20:51.937 --> 20:53.427
The front act at the next gig...

20:53.857 --> 20:55.647
Hey, let's skip club and go to a movie.

21:01.607 --> 21:02.247
Taki.

21:04.357 --> 21:05.877
Arriving at noon, huh?

21:06.407 --> 21:07.207
Let's eat lunch.

21:08.677 --> 21:10.097
You ignored my text.

21:11.157 --> 21:12.117
Tsukasa-kun?

21:12.147 --> 21:14.337
At least you sound apologetic.

21:16.727 --> 21:17.807
- You got lost?

21:18.127 --> 21:18.527
- Yeah.

21:19.077 --> 21:22.727
How could you get lost
on the way to school?

21:22.817 --> 21:25.767
- Uh... Well... I... (watashi)...

21:25.857 --> 21:26.357
- Feminine?

21:26.447 --> 21:27.507
I... (watakushi)!

21:28.767 --> 21:29.287
I... (boku)?

21:30.247 --> 21:30.847
I... (ore)?

21:33.427 --> 21:38.687
I was enjoying myself.
It's so festive and all in Tokyo.

21:39.807 --> 21:41.507
You seem to have a dialect.

21:42.147 --> 21:43.187
Where's your bentou, Taki?

21:44.207 --> 21:45.207
- Geez.

21:45.247 --> 21:46.547
- Are you half asleep?

21:46.927 --> 21:47.697
- You got something?

21:47.887 --> 21:49.747
- Croquette-egg sandwich sounds good!

21:50.387 --> 21:50.737
Boom!

21:54.277 --> 21:55.347
Thank you.

21:57.747 --> 21:59.077
Let's go to a café.

21:59.167 --> 22:01.377
Oh that one? OK. Coming, Taki?

22:01.827 --> 22:04.417
What? What? What?

22:04.977 --> 22:05.927
A café?

22:09.647 --> 22:11.267
Nice woodwork up there.

22:11.477 --> 22:13.297
Yeah, nice attention to detail.

22:13.827 --> 22:15.027
Taki, have you decided?

22:16.447 --> 22:21.057
What? I could live for a month
for the price of these!

22:21.087 --> 22:23.427
What age are you from again?

22:23.807 --> 22:27.327
Hmm... Oh well. It's a dream anyway.

22:34.087 --> 22:35.057
What a great dream.

22:41.347 --> 22:44.367
Oh no, what should I do?
I'm late for work!

22:45.047 --> 22:46.287
Your shift is today?

22:46.977 --> 22:48.727
- Go, then.
- Oh, yeah.

22:50.247 --> 22:52.367
Oh! Um...

22:53.767 --> 22:56.247
Where do I work?

22:56.387 --> 22:57.457
What?

23:03.857 --> 23:05.797
Tables 6, 7, and 10 are waiting!

23:06.487 --> 23:08.197
Table 12! Taki!

23:09.397 --> 23:10.597
Here you go.

23:10.967 --> 23:13.827
Uh, zucchini and tomato salad...

23:14.047 --> 23:15.367
We didn't order that.

23:15.557 --> 23:17.907
Taki, I said no more truffles!

23:18.177 --> 23:20.167
Taki, can't hear you!

23:20.177 --> 23:20.997
Taki!

23:22.627 --> 23:24.927
When is this dream going to end?

23:33.407 --> 23:35.407
Hey. Hey boy.

23:36.177 --> 23:36.627
Yes?

23:39.047 --> 23:41.797
There was a toothpick in our pizza.

23:42.647 --> 23:45.317
We could have gotten hurt.

23:45.827 --> 23:49.777
Good thing I noticed.
What do you have to say?

23:50.547 --> 23:52.227
Uh, we...

23:53.007 --> 23:56.867
But... There are no toothpicks
in an Italian restaurant's...

23:58.817 --> 23:59.567
Excuse me.

24:00.687 --> 24:02.207
Is everything okay?

24:03.487 --> 24:04.307
I'll handle this.

24:06.087 --> 24:07.647
What's wrong with you today?

24:09.317 --> 24:12.707
Please accept our apologies.
Your meal is on the house.

24:12.757 --> 24:13.537
Oh, really?

24:13.907 --> 24:15.667
I hope you weren't hurt.

24:26.567 --> 24:27.127
Um...

24:27.797 --> 24:28.817
Okudera-san...

24:28.977 --> 24:29.727
It's your senpai, right?

24:30.897 --> 24:32.997
Okudera-senpai. Thank you...

24:33.057 --> 24:34.447
A stroke of bad luck today.

24:34.567 --> 24:35.727
No, uh...

24:35.767 --> 24:37.287
Bet it was a set-up.

24:37.807 --> 24:40.147
Handled it according to the manual, but...

24:41.527 --> 24:44.007
Oh, Okudera-san, your skirt!

24:45.697 --> 24:46.767
You okay?

24:46.817 --> 24:48.837
- What happened?
- Slashed.

24:49.407 --> 24:51.007
That dick from earlier?

24:51.137 --> 24:53.347
What now? Do you remember his face?

24:53.397 --> 24:53.797
No.

24:54.967 --> 24:56.167
Senpai, come with me.

24:56.967 --> 24:57.877
Hey, Taki!

24:59.367 --> 25:00.577
Take off your skirt.

25:01.087 --> 25:03.367
Oh! I'll look the other way!

25:07.807 --> 25:09.127
This won't take long.

25:14.037 --> 25:14.707
Done!

25:16.787 --> 25:19.937
Wow, Taki-kun! It looks better than before!

25:22.007 --> 25:24.847
Thank you for saving me today.

25:27.137 --> 25:30.337
Actually, I was concerned about you.

25:30.967 --> 25:33.537
You're weak but quick-tempered.

25:34.947 --> 25:36.327
I like you better today.

25:37.397 --> 25:40.247
Never knew you had a feminine side.

25:42.047 --> 25:43.917
"JR Yamanote Line: 8 min."

25:51.527 --> 25:54.407
What a realistic dream
if I say so myself.

25:59.167 --> 26:01.137
Oh, he keeps a diary.

26:06.337 --> 26:07.377
He's so organized.

26:08.387 --> 26:10.177
Wish I lived in Tokyo too.

26:13.557 --> 26:15.527
Oh! That's her!

26:21.007 --> 26:22.387
A crush, maybe?

26:28.527 --> 26:28.567
{=71}m 744 -72 l 748 824 3196 822 3206 -64

26:28.527 --> 26:28.567
