29:52.027 --> 29:53.527
switching places?

29:53.527 --> 29:55.527
{Zenzenzense}

30:08.427 --> 30:12.567
At last, hello you've opened your eyes

30:12.987 --> 30:17.227
But, why won't you even look me in the eyes, what's wrong with you?

30:18.717 --> 30:22.447
You angrily tell me that I'm late

30:23.217 --> 30:27.527
Well, I'm sorry, but I did my best and running at my fastest pace

30:27.817 --> 30:31.147
I'm beginning to get what's going on.

30:28.247 --> 30:32.997
My heart overtook my body as it flew to find you in this place

30:31.167 --> 30:34.127
Taki-kun is living in Tokyo, and he is attending to high school, like me.

30:33.967 --> 30:37.707
Where should I start? How should I explain?

30:34.687 --> 30:37.377
I switch with Mitsuha at random,

30:37.667 --> 30:39.777
a few times a week unexpectedly.

30:38.367 --> 30:42.567
Wanna tell you everything that happened while you were in a long long dream

30:40.407 --> 30:43.167
Sleep triggers it.
The cause is a mystery.

