31:09.067 --> 31:14.407
Now that I'm finally faced with the voice I've known for so long

31:10.947 --> 31:15.047
To work together to tide over
this mysterious phenomenon.

31:14.407 --> 31:21.537
I don't know what the words should be the very first I say to you

31:16.047 --> 31:17.457
But...

31:17.567 --> 31:18.917
But...

31:19.377 --> 31:21.637
- That guy!
- That girl!

31:21.537 --> 31:26.217
Back in the Zenzenzense 'til this day, been looking everywhere for you

31:26.217 --> 31:31.617
I follow the sound of your innocent laughter, and it guided me in the right way

31:31.617 --> 31:36.367
Even if every piece of you disappeared, and if it scattered everywhere

31:36.307 --> 31:40.917
Guys are staring! Watch the skirt!
Come on, this is basic!

31:36.367 --> 31:41.217
No, I wouldn't waver, I would start back at one. Look for you all over again

31:41.207 --> 31:46.617
Or maybe instead I'll take the whole universe
Right back to zero again

31:43.967 --> 31:46.017
Stop wasting my money!

31:46.037 --> 31:49.137
It's YOUR body eating.
And I'm working too!

31:49.167 --> 31:51.107
Braided cords... I can't do this!

31:51.117 --> 31:53.137
You work too many shifts!

31:53.167 --> 31:54.687
It's 'cause you waste money!

31:54.837 --> 31:58.457
I wonder if we can push our way through

31:59.207 --> 32:03.837
The countless barriers that's waiting in the future just beyond our view

32:04.967 --> 32:08.617
Side by side, no way we can lose

32:09.327 --> 32:13.737
We'll beat destiny at its own game and make it follow our own rules

32:14.387 --> 32:19.307
And there isn't any weapon besides you that I need to use

32:14.967 --> 32:19.427
Grabbed coffee with Okudera-senpai.
You two have a good thing going!

32:19.487 --> 32:22.887
Mitsuha, stop changing my relationships!

32:20.047 --> 32:24.387
Zenzenzense 'til this day
Been looking everywhere for you

32:23.107 --> 32:26.407
Taki-kun, why is a girl in love with me?

32:24.397 --> 32:29.257
No more hesitation, I will put up a flag
To stake my claim on your heart tonight

32:26.707 --> 32:29.447
You're more popular when I'm you.

32:29.257 --> 32:34.737
'Cause you took away from me the will to give up
so clearly and awkwardly

32:29.537 --> 32:32.367
Don't be full of yourself!
Not like YOU have a girlfriend!

