We're going now!
Get ready!

33:12.997 --> 33:17.057
The comet Tiamat has been visible to the naked eye for a few days now.

33:17.457 --> 33:19.167
Where and when can it be seen?

33:19.937 --> 33:25.567
Tiamat is moving from east to west, as if to follow the sun.

33:25.907 --> 33:30.767
So it can be seen above Venus if you look up at the sky just after–

33:27.797 --> 33:29.367
Why the uniform?

33:37.607 --> 33:42.387
Grandma, why is the body
of our shrine's god so far away?

33:43.207 --> 33:46.097
I don't know because of Mayugoro.

33:46.687 --> 33:47.507
Who's that?

33:47.877 --> 33:49.267
What? He's famous!

33:58.007 --> 33:59.327
Here, Grandma.

34:04.257 --> 34:06.387
Whoa, Onee-chan.

34:17.777 --> 34:21.827
Mitsuha, Yotsuha, do you know "Musubi?"

34:22.357 --> 34:23.277
Musubi?

34:23.347 --> 34:28.387
Musubi is the old way of calling
the local guardian god.

34:28.917 --> 34:31.487
This word has profound meaning.

34:32.387 --> 34:37.557
Tying thread is Musubi.
Connecting people is Musubi.

34:38.007 --> 34:40.417
The flow of time is Musubi.

34:41.127 --> 34:43.237
These are all the god's power.

34:44.287 --> 34:46.847
So the braided cords that we make

34:47.377 --> 34:52.647
are the god's art and represent
the flow of time itself.

34:53.767 --> 34:56.227
They converge and take shape.

34:56.687 --> 34:58.707
They twist, tangle

34:59.207 --> 35:02.867
sometimes unravel, break,
then connect again.

35:04.287 --> 35:07.647
Musubi - knotting. That's time.

35:11.157 --> 35:12.007
Drink.

35:12.287 --> 35:13.157
Thank you.

35:14.807 --> 35:15.667
I want some too!

35:16.327 --> 35:18.017
That's also Musubi.

35:19.847 --> 35:22.037
Whether it be water, rice, or sake,

35:22.437 --> 35:27.647
when a person consumes something and
it joins their soul, that's Musubi.

35:28.177 --> 35:30.577
So today's offering

35:30.817 --> 35:35.957
is an important custom that
connects the god and people.

35:37.907 --> 35:39.217
Hey, I see it!

35:42.847 --> 35:47.107
That's the body
of Miyamizu Shrine's god?

36:04.607 --> 36:07.207
Beyond this point is "kakuriyo."

36:08.287 --> 36:10.067
It means the underworld.

36:11.397 --> 36:12.527
It's the underworld!

36:16.257 --> 36:20.817
In exchange for returning to this world,
you must leave behind

36:20.947 --> 36:22.967
what is most important to you.

36:25.127 --> 36:26.997
The Kuchikamizake.

36:28.257 --> 36:29.537
The Kuchikamizake?

36:30.117 --> 36:33.267
You'll offer it inside the god's body.

36:33.987 --> 36:37.347
It's half of you.

36:38.597 --> 36:40.707
Half of Mitsuha...

36:59.027 --> 37:00.867
It's twilight - "kataware-doki" already.

37:01.827 --> 37:03.367
Kataware-doki?

37:13.777 --> 37:14.467
Oh yeah,

37:14.967 --> 37:16.277
maybe I can see the comet.

37:18.087 --> 37:19.327
The comet?

37:20.337 --> 37:21.047
Oh,

37:21.877 --> 37:22.897
Mitsuha,

37:23.637 --> 37:26.927
you're dreaming right now, aren't you?

37:38.257 --> 37:40.597
Tears? Why?

37:42.997 --> 37:45.497
I'm almost there.

37:42.997 --> 37:45.497
Looking forward to it!

37:46.067 --> 37:47.187
Okudera-senpai?

37:48.257 --> 37:49.087
What's she talking about?

37:50.757 --> 37:52.097
What did Mitsuha do this time?

37:54.327 --> 37:55.217
A date!?

38:02.967 --> 38:05.777
A Tokyo date with Okudera-senpai tomorrow!

38:06.487 --> 38:08.607
Meet at 10:30 at the station!

38:10.197 --> 38:13.107
...was what I'd planned, but...

38:27.667 --> 38:28.447
Taki-kun.

38:30.327 --> 38:31.507
Sorry. Did you wait long?

38:31.617 --> 38:34.807
Yes. Wait, no. Uh, I mean...

38:43.887 --> 38:45.207
I just got here.

38:45.347 --> 38:46.007
That's good.

38:46.847 --> 38:47.447
Let's go.

38:49.247 --> 38:50.437
He's so lucky.

38:50.927 --> 38:52.687
They must be together about now.

38:56.927 --> 38:57.537
Huh?

39:02.037 --> 39:02.887
I'm...

39:04.437 --> 39:05.267
Why?

39:12.167 --> 39:14.327
I wanted to go on this date,

39:14.867 --> 39:20.037
but if it so happens that you
end up going, you better be grateful and enjoy it!

39:20.167 --> 39:22.887
It's my first time eating here.

39:23.647 --> 39:25.297
How about you, Taki-kun?

39:24.597 --> 39:28.867
However, I'm sure you've never
gone out on a date before,

39:27.807 --> 39:29.207
I've never been here before!

39:30.977 --> 39:32.927
I don't know what to say...

39:33.187 --> 39:37.537
so below are some links
to help you out, you late bloomer.

39:37.877 --> 39:38.337
Really?

