39:46.337 --> 39:47.877
She's making fun of me.

40:17.217 --> 40:18.307
Taki-kun.

40:19.687 --> 40:22.357
You're like a different person today.

40:33.107 --> 40:33.987
Um, senpai...

40:34.727 --> 40:37.207
Are you hungry? How about dinner...

40:38.997 --> 40:40.437
Let's call it a day.

40:42.517 --> 40:43.007
Okay.

40:43.987 --> 40:44.927
Taki-kun, you—

40:45.857 --> 40:47.187
Sorry if I'm wrong.

40:47.297 --> 40:47.767
Sure.

40:48.767 --> 40:52.487
You used to have a bit of a crush on me, right?

40:53.827 --> 40:56.437
But now you like someone else.

40:58.127 --> 41:00.407
N-No, I don't.

41:00.547 --> 41:01.367
Really?

41:01.587 --> 41:03.987
No! That's not true at all.

41:04.227 --> 41:05.397
I wonder.

41:07.237 --> 41:10.577
Oh well. Thanks for today. See you at work.

41:25.207 --> 41:26.687
By the time the date is over,

41:27.217 --> 41:30.067
the comet will be visible in the sky.

41:34.067 --> 41:35.987
What is she saying?

