42:05.107 --> 42:07.217
Oh, it's you, Tessie.

42:08.817 --> 42:13.207
No, I just didn't feel like going,
that's all. I'm fine.

42:14.447 --> 42:17.697
What? The festival? Well...

42:18.327 --> 42:23.667
Oh yeah, the comet. Today's the peak
of its brightness, isn't it?

42:24.647 --> 42:27.347
OK, got it. Later, then.

42:29.807 --> 42:33.167
You just want to see her in a yukata.

42:33.187 --> 42:34.787
What I? No!

42:35.247 --> 42:37.047
That didn't even occur to me.

42:39.397 --> 42:41.427
Hey, she sounded kind of down.

42:41.607 --> 42:43.667
Maybe you annoyed her.

42:43.727 --> 42:44.607
Come on!

42:44.887 --> 42:45.747
Sorry I'm late.

42:45.927 --> 42:47.007
- Here she is!
- Finally!

42:48.927 --> 42:52.497
- Your... your...
- Oh! What happened, Mitsuha?

42:53.647 --> 42:54.547
Your hair!

42:56.097 --> 42:58.307
Looks kinda funny, I guess?

43:07.477 --> 43:10.997
You think some guy is the reason?
Ditched, maybe?

43:11.077 --> 43:14.147
Why do guys associate
cutting hair with breakups?

43:14.357 --> 43:16.547
She said she just felt like it.

43:16.577 --> 43:20.097
Really? She just felt like cutting off
that much hair?

43:20.147 --> 43:22.927
Oh! Hey! You can see it!

43:41.427 --> 43:43.157
Wow!

44:01.907 --> 44:07.107
The number you are trying to call is not
reachable or has been turned off...

44:10.117 --> 44:14.767
I'll tell her about the disastrous date
the next time we switch,

44:15.487 --> 44:18.097
I thought. But...

44:18.847 --> 44:20.487
For some reason, after that,

44:21.857 --> 44:25.427
Mitsuha and I never
switched places again.

