46:18.997 --> 46:23.167
What the... What are you doing here?

46:26.337 --> 46:28.407
Tsukasa-kun told me and here I am!

46:32.627 --> 46:37.827
Tsukasa, I asked you to cover for me
at home and at work.

46:38.257 --> 46:39.667
Takagi will cover your shift.

46:39.807 --> 46:42.447
Leave it to me! But you owe me a meal!

46:43.347 --> 46:44.597
This isn't funny.

46:44.967 --> 46:47.217
- We were worried about you.
- Huh?

46:47.397 --> 46:50.567
You can't go alone. What if it's a con act?

46:50.627 --> 46:51.617
A con act?

46:51.857 --> 46:54.197
You're meeting an online friend.

46:54.207 --> 46:56.627
Well no, not exactly...

46:56.647 --> 46:58.807
- I think he's using a dating site.
- No!

46:59.727 --> 47:03.647
You've been acting weird lately.
We'll keep an eye on you.

47:03.667 --> 47:05.057
I'm not a kid!

47:07.527 --> 47:11.507
The switching stopped.
My calls and texts didn't go through.

47:12.757 --> 47:16.207
So I decided to go see Mitsuha
in person.

47:17.537 --> 47:20.207
I wanted to meet her. But...

47:22.327 --> 47:27.167
What? You don't know where?
The town's scenery is your only clue?

47:27.807 --> 47:28.447
Yes.

47:31.427 --> 47:34.647
And you can't contact her?
What's this all about?

47:34.977 --> 47:37.877
Seriously. What a lousy tour planner.

47:37.887 --> 47:39.057
I did not plan a tour!

47:39.207 --> 47:42.227
Oh well. We'll help you look for her.

47:42.607 --> 47:44.917
Oh how cute! Look!

47:45.887 --> 47:46.947
So annoying.

47:46.977 --> 47:47.487
Oh, it moved!

48:17.057 --> 48:19.237
So it's impossible after all...

48:19.297 --> 48:22.817
What? After all the trouble
we went through?

48:25.937 --> 48:27.617
You haven't done anything.

48:31.617 --> 48:33.037
One Takayama ramen.

48:33.157 --> 48:34.567
One Takayama ramen.

48:34.707 --> 48:36.367
Oh, then a Takayama ramen for me, too.

48:36.497 --> 48:39.647
- Okay. Three ramens.
- Okay.

48:41.827 --> 48:44.047
Can we return to Tokyo today?

48:44.307 --> 48:47.267
We could be cutting it close.
I'll check.

48:47.647 --> 48:48.227
Thanks.

48:48.437 --> 48:50.527
Are you all right with that?

48:53.477 --> 48:57.207
I'm starting to feel like
I'm barking up the wrong tree.

49:01.857 --> 49:05.027
Why young man,
that's Itomori, isn't it?

49:06.837 --> 49:09.967
It's a very good drawing.
Isn't it, dear?

49:11.687 --> 49:15.007
Yeah, it's Itomori.
Brings back memories.

49:15.317 --> 49:17.217
He was born in Itomori.

49:17.697 --> 49:18.547
Itomori...?

49:20.887 --> 49:25.487
Yes! Itomori Town! That's it!
It's nearby, isn't it?

49:25.907 --> 49:28.497
- What are you...
- Itomori was...

49:28.867 --> 49:31.667
Itomori? No way!

49:31.767 --> 49:33.927
Is it where that comet...?

49:42.337 --> 49:45.337
DO NOT

49:42.337 --> 49:45.337
ENTER

50:23.767 --> 50:26.947
Hey. Is this really the place?

50:27.167 --> 50:30.567
No way! Taki-kun must be misremembering.

50:31.237 --> 50:34.257
No. I'm sure this is it.

50:35.137 --> 50:40.207
This schoolyard. The mountains.
I remember this high school clearly!

50:40.527 --> 50:42.257
That can't be true!

50:42.757 --> 50:47.167
Surely you remember that disaster
that took hundreds of lives three years ago!

50:48.647 --> 50:49.287
Died?

50:50.977 --> 50:53.857
Died three years ago?

50:56.327 --> 50:56.927
That can't be.

50:57.857 --> 51:01.857
I still have the memos
that she left behind...

51:19.377 --> 51:20.337
They're disappearing...

