52:37.777 --> 52:42.757
It has to be some kind of mistake.
This person died three years ago!

52:42.767 --> 52:48.817
Just two or three weeks ago, she said to me
that the comet would be visible.

52:49.077 --> 52:49.687
So...

52:50.147 --> 52:51.047
You're dreaming now...

52:52.687 --> 52:53.247
I...

52:53.397 --> 52:55.187
...aren't you?

52:56.047 --> 52:56.647
I...

52:59.327 --> 52:59.987
What did l...?

53:14.967 --> 53:16.227
Lively up there.

53:16.787 --> 53:19.207
I'm sorry we could only get one room.

53:19.527 --> 53:20.947
No problem.

53:22.117 --> 53:22.997
How's Taki-kun?

53:23.207 --> 53:26.047
He's still reading articles on Itomori.

53:26.567 --> 53:29.777
Newspapers and magazines
at the time at random it seems.

53:34.977 --> 53:38.327
- What?
- Nothing. I didn't know you smoked.

53:38.687 --> 53:41.507
Oh. I'd quit recently, but...

53:42.787 --> 53:45.267
What do you think about his story?

53:49.137 --> 53:50.767
I liked him.

53:51.877 --> 53:57.107
The way he was recently. He was always
a nice guy, but even more so lately.

53:58.177 --> 54:01.027
Like he was trying so hard. It was cute.

54:02.807 --> 54:06.357
What he's saying
doesn't make sense to me...

54:09.217 --> 54:14.207
But I'm sure he met someone
and that someone changed him.

54:16.117 --> 54:18.807
That much is for sure, I think.

54:18.757 --> 54:19.807
Worst-ever Itomori Comet Disaster

54:32.847 --> 54:34.787
It was all just a dream.

54:36.647 --> 54:41.957
I recognized the scenery because
I remembered the news from three years ago.

54:43.647 --> 54:46.287
If not that, then... a ghost?

54:47.137 --> 54:51.427
No... Was I fantasizing?

54:55.797 --> 54:59.047
Her name... What was it?

55:02.147 --> 55:04.287
Tsukasa-kun went to take a bath.

55:05.057 --> 55:08.287
Oh, Senpai. I, uh...

55:08.917 --> 55:14.417
I've been saying such strange things.
Thank you for coming along today.

55:18.627 --> 55:19.427
No problem.

