gave it to me a long time ago.

55:36.687 --> 55:39.877
I wear it sometimes
as kind of a lucky charm...

55:42.807 --> 55:43.617
Who was it?

55:46.177 --> 55:49.077
Why don't you go take a bath, too?

55:49.377 --> 55:50.767
Yes... No.

55:54.127 --> 55:58.337
Someone who makes braided cords
told me before...

55:58.897 --> 56:01.377
The cords represent
the flow of time itself.

56:02.097 --> 56:07.647
The threads twist, tangle,
unravel, and connect again. That's time...

56:10.307 --> 56:11.287
