57:00.857 --> 57:05.867
Okudera-senpai,

57:00.857 --> 57:05.867
Tsukasa,

57:00.857 --> 57:05.867
There's one last place

57:00.857 --> 57:05.867
I have to check

57:00.857 --> 57:05.867
Please go

57:00.857 --> 57:05.867
back to Tokyo

57:00.857 --> 57:05.867
without me.

57:00.857 --> 57:05.867
I swear I'll come back later.

57:00.857 --> 57:05.867
Thanks.

57:00.857 --> 57:05.867
TAKI

57:09.207 --> 57:09.877
Taki-kun...

57:34.407 --> 57:36.337
Eat this up there.

57:37.747 --> 57:41.367
Your drawing of Itomori... It was good.

58:18.897 --> 58:23.157
They converge and take shape.
They twist, tangle,

58:23.777 --> 58:26.687
sometimes unravel,
then connect again...

58:28.497 --> 58:32.787
That's Musubi. That's time.

58:43.297 --> 58:44.037
There it is!

58:46.647 --> 58:47.717
It's really there!

58:49.777 --> 58:51.697
It wasn't just a dream!

59:23.027 --> 59:25.207
From here is the underworld.

59:49.137 --> 59:51.367
It's the sake we brought.

59:53.167 --> 59:56.047
This is my sister's, and this is mine.

59:59.397 --> 01:00:06.067
Before the comet struck... So the
Mitsuha I know is from three years ago?

01:00:08.067 --> 01:00:10.907
Our timelines weren't in step.

01:00:12.737 --> 01:00:14.287
Half of her...

01:00:29.567 --> 01:00:30.227
Musubi.

01:00:32.387 --> 01:00:34.597
If time can really be turned back,

01:00:36.327 --> 01:00:37.317
give me one last chance...

01:00:52.417 --> 01:00:53.477
The comet!

01:01:59.107 --> 01:02:01.587
Your name is Mitsuha.

01:02:08.657 --> 01:02:11.107
You're both my treasures.

01:02:11.127 --> 01:02:13.287
You're an older sister now.

