01:02:20.307 --> 01:02:23.317
Dad, when is Mom going to come home?

01:02:24.787 --> 01:02:26.087
I couldn't save her.

01:02:26.127 --> 01:02:27.907
Get a hold of yourself!

01:02:28.167 --> 01:02:29.747
Who cares about the shrine?

01:02:29.747 --> 01:02:31.157
You're the adopted son-in-law!

01:02:31.317 --> 01:02:34.447
I loved my wife Futaba.
Not Miyamizu Shrine.

01:02:34.497 --> 01:02:35.317
Get out of here!

01:02:38.437 --> 01:02:40.547
Mitsuha, Yotsuha,

01:02:41.107 --> 01:02:43.907
you'll be with Grandma from now on.

01:02:49.057 --> 01:02:50.407
Who am I?

01:02:49.147 --> 01:02:50.357
