01:02:52.177 --> 01:02:54.657
Don't be full of yourself.
Not like YOU have a girlfriend.

01:02:55.367 --> 01:02:58.437
He's so lucky. They must be together
around now...

01:03:00.277 --> 01:03:01.107
I...

01:03:01.637 --> 01:03:02.927
I'm going to Tokyo.

01:03:02.947 --> 01:03:04.147
What? Hey, Nee-chan!

01:03:07.167 --> 01:03:10.257
Grandma, could you do me a favor?

01:03:11.937 --> 01:03:14.037
Oh yeah, the comet.

01:03:14.917 --> 01:03:17.837
Today's the peak of its brightness...

01:03:18.087 --> 01:03:19.967
Mitsuha! Don't stay there!

01:03:21.137 --> 01:03:25.517
Mitsuha, get out of there
before the comet strikes!

01:03:28.097 --> 01:03:30.017
Mitsuha, get out of there!

01:03:30.857 --> 01:03:33.147
Mitsuha! Mitsuha!

01:03:33.437 --> 01:03:35.357
Mitsuha!

01:03:53.667 --> 01:03:56.207
I'm Mitsuha! She's still alive!

01:04:07.637 --> 01:04:09.447
Onee-chan, are you touching...

01:04:12.357 --> 01:04:13.927
My younger sister!

01:04:16.197 --> 01:04:18.197
Yotsuha!

01:04:21.377 --> 01:04:23.647
Onee-chan has finally lost it.

01:04:24.227 --> 01:04:26.417
I'm leaving without her.

01:04:27.077 --> 01:04:28.627
She's lost it.

01:04:29.167 --> 01:04:31.267
She's completely lost it.

01:04:31.777 --> 01:04:32.387
Scary.

01:04:33.297 --> 01:04:37.407
Comet Tiamat has been visible
to the naked eye for a few days now.

01:04:37.797 --> 01:04:41.607
Tonight it will finally reach
its perigee around 7:40PM,

01:04:41.757 --> 01:04:44.147
and will achieve its maximum brightness.

01:04:44.487 --> 01:04:46.947
It's tonight. There's still time.

01:04:48.047 --> 01:04:49.377
Good morning, Mitsuha.

01:04:50.227 --> 01:04:51.027
Oh...

01:04:52.417 --> 01:04:55.317
You're not Mitsuha, are you?

01:04:56.247 --> 01:04:59.247
You knew, Grandma?

01:05:00.037 --> 01:05:06.117
No, but watching the way you behaved
lately triggered some memories.

01:05:07.447 --> 01:05:12.467
I also remember seeing strange dreams
when I was a young girl.

01:05:13.967 --> 01:05:19.457
Although now I've forgotten about
whose life I was dreaming about.

01:05:20.447 --> 01:05:21.267
Forgotten...

01:05:21.687 --> 01:05:26.387
Treasure the experience.
Dreams fade away after you wake up.

01:05:27.287 --> 01:05:31.557
There were times your mother and I
had similar experiences.

01:05:32.737 --> 01:05:36.397
Maybe those dreams that
the Miyamizu people had

01:05:37.107 --> 01:05:39.487
were all for what will happen today.

01:05:40.497 --> 01:05:42.327
Grandma, listen.

01:05:43.077 --> 01:05:47.847
A comet will strike Itomori tonight
and everyone will die.

01:05:55.367 --> 01:06:00.127
"Nobody will believe that?" What a
surprisingly ordinary reply, Grandma.

01:06:01.167 --> 01:06:03.027
I won't let them die!

01:06:04.577 --> 01:06:06.967
Oh! What happened, Mitsuha?

01:06:07.247 --> 01:06:11.617
Your... your hair!

01:06:11.717 --> 01:06:14.167
Oh, this. It looked better before, huh?

01:06:14.387 --> 01:06:15.767
Oh, that's it?

01:06:15.987 --> 01:06:19.617
Forget that! If nothing is done,
everyone will die tonight!

01:06:22.337 --> 01:06:24.197
So we have to act!

01:06:29.287 --> 01:06:31.087
Why aren't you at school, Sayaka-chan?

01:06:31.207 --> 01:06:35.447
Uh... We have to save the town.

01:06:37.567 --> 01:06:38.517
The community wireless system?

01:06:38.867 --> 01:06:41.007
Yeah, those speakers you see everywhere.

