01:06:46.047 --> 01:06:50.037
I see! That could work!
You're awesome, Tessie!

01:06:50.127 --> 01:06:52.487
Hey! Don't come so close!

01:06:52.627 --> 01:06:54.627
What, embarrassed? Hey, hey!

01:06:54.917 --> 01:06:57.607
Stop! A single girl your age—that ain't proper!

01:06:58.477 --> 01:07:00.857
Club Discontinued - Keep Out

01:07:00.117 --> 01:07:02.007
You're such a nice guy!

01:07:06.227 --> 01:07:08.467
Got them. Here's your change.

01:07:08.487 --> 01:07:09.557
Sorry, Saya-chin.

01:07:09.957 --> 01:07:11.267
It's all right.

01:07:11.527 --> 01:07:13.797
- What a cheap fee.
- Deal with it.

01:07:15.777 --> 01:07:19.267
What about you? Have you come up
with an escape plan?

01:07:23.127 --> 01:07:25.457
Wh-What? A bomb?

01:07:26.127 --> 01:07:30.337
We have water gel explosives
for construction at our storage site.

01:07:30.497 --> 01:07:31.727
Broadcast hijacking?

01:07:32.357 --> 01:07:37.007
The town's wireless system can be easily
jacked using the start-up frequency.

01:07:37.137 --> 01:07:40.967
So we can broadcast an evacuation
warning from the school.

01:07:41.347 --> 01:07:45.807
The school is outside the disaster area,
so people can evacuate here.

01:07:46.647 --> 01:07:49.427
It's... It's totally a crime!

01:07:49.447 --> 01:07:51.007
You do the broadcast.

01:07:51.087 --> 01:07:53.237
- Why?
- You're in the broadcast club.

01:07:53.767 --> 01:07:55.287
I'm in charge of explosives.

01:07:55.527 --> 01:07:57.347
I'll go talk to the mayor.

01:07:58.167 --> 01:08:02.037
In the end, the city council
has to evacuate everyone.

01:08:02.147 --> 01:08:05.207
I'm his daughter. I can persuade him.

01:08:05.267 --> 01:08:07.087
It's a perfect plan.

01:08:08.437 --> 01:08:13.087
Oh, whatever. It's just a
what-if fantasy, isn't it?

01:08:13.367 --> 01:08:15.557
What? Well...

01:08:15.717 --> 01:08:19.767
Not necessarily! Do you know
how Lake Itomori was formed?

01:08:19.807 --> 01:08:23.687
A meteor crater lake formed 1,200 years ago.

01:08:20.277 --> 01:08:25.507
It's a meteor crater! So one did strike
this area a thousand years ago!

01:08:25.857 --> 01:08:27.567
Oh! So that's why...

01:08:27.877 --> 01:08:29.267
You're right, Tessie!

01:08:33.587 --> 01:08:35.347
Let's do it together!

01:08:39.617 --> 01:08:41.807
What on earth are you talking about?

01:08:44.097 --> 01:08:47.727
I said we have to evacuate everyone
in town before tonight or...

01:08:47.747 --> 01:08:48.807
Shut your mouth.

01:08:54.897 --> 01:08:57.477
"The comet will split and
strike the town?"

01:08:58.097 --> 01:09:00.977
Itomori Town Hall

01:08:58.097 --> 01:09:00.977
"Over 500 people will die?"

01:09:01.507 --> 01:09:03.927
How dare you spout such nonsense?

01:09:05.057 --> 01:09:07.317
If you're serious, then you're sick.

01:09:08.487 --> 01:09:10.787
Madness must be from the Miyamizu side.

01:09:12.727 --> 01:09:16.327
I'll get someone to drive you
to a hospital in the city.

01:09:17.267 --> 01:09:20.597
I'll listen to you
after a doctor examines you.

01:09:24.407 --> 01:09:25.607
How dare you mocking me!

01:09:34.407 --> 01:09:37.427
Mitsuha! No...

01:09:38.837 --> 01:09:39.697
Who...

01:09:41.727 --> 01:09:42.197
Who are you?

01:09:57.407 --> 01:09:59.987
See you later at the festival. Bye...

01:09:59.607 --> 01:10:00.927
Let's meet at the shrine.

01:10:01.477 --> 01:10:02.417
- Don't be late.
- Bye!

01:10:02.577 --> 01:10:04.007
- See you.
- Later.

01:10:05.747 --> 01:10:06.767
You shouldn't go!

01:10:07.697 --> 01:10:10.287
Get out of town. Tell your friends.

01:10:10.337 --> 01:10:11.367
What are you saying?

01:10:11.667 --> 01:10:12.787
Onee-chan!

01:10:12.817 --> 01:10:14.647
- What was that?
- Let's go.

01:10:15.397 --> 01:10:17.027
What are you doing?

01:10:18.307 --> 01:10:19.237
Could Mitsuha...

01:10:20.147 --> 01:10:23.407
Could she have persuaded them?
Is it my fault?

01:10:24.197 --> 01:10:27.717
Yotsuha, leave town with Grandma
before nightfall.

01:10:28.277 --> 01:10:29.987
You'll die if you stay here!

01:10:30.017 --> 01:10:31.637
What are you saying?

01:10:32.067 --> 01:10:36.327
Yesterday you suddenly went to Tokyo.
What's wrong with you?

01:10:38.337 --> 01:10:38.867
Tokyo?

01:10:39.847 --> 01:10:42.047
Hey, Mitsuha!

01:10:44.707 --> 01:10:46.247
How did it go with your old man?

01:10:49.027 --> 01:10:50.167
Hey, Mitsuha?

01:10:51.527 --> 01:10:52.417
What's wrong with you older sister?

01:10:52.647 --> 01:10:53.527
No idea.

01:11:03.967 --> 01:11:05.247
Are you there?

01:11:06.577 --> 01:11:08.597
Is something over there?

01:11:09.157 --> 01:11:10.527
Let me use your bike.

01:11:10.727 --> 01:11:11.217
Hey, what the...

01:11:11.827 --> 01:11:12.567
Hey, Mitsuha!

01:11:14.367 --> 01:11:15.267
What about our plan?

01:11:15.747 --> 01:11:17.507
Get ready as planned!

01:11:18.087 --> 01:11:18.977
Please!

01:11:45.507 --> 01:11:48.067
I'm in Taki-kun's body.

01:11:51.557 --> 01:11:53.527
What is Taki-kun doing here?

01:12:03.507 --> 01:12:04.207
The town...

01:12:05.537 --> 01:12:06.117
is gone.

01:12:16.327 --> 01:12:19.267
At that moment... did I...

01:12:23.297 --> 01:12:24.287
die?

01:12:34.597 --> 01:12:37.297
Taki-kun. Taki-kun.

01:12:40.037 --> 01:12:41.747
Don't you remember me?

01:12:54.357 --> 01:12:56.357
I'm going to Tokyo.

01:12:56.487 --> 01:12:57.747
What? Now?

01:12:58.167 --> 01:12:58.787
Why?

01:12:59.697 --> 01:13:00.207
A date.

01:13:00.967 --> 01:13:02.887
You have a boyfriend in Tokyo?

01:13:03.167 --> 01:13:04.727
Not my date.

01:13:06.727 --> 01:13:07.847
I'll come home tonight.

01:13:11.317 --> 01:13:16.007
If I suddenly showed up,
would I bother him? Surprise him?

01:13:16.737 --> 01:13:18.997
He might not like it.

01:13:27.187 --> 01:13:30.807
The number you are trying to call
is not reachable...

01:13:30.947 --> 01:13:32.047
There's no way we could meet.

01:13:33.037 --> 01:13:34.807
But what if we did?

01:13:35.957 --> 01:13:40.197
What should I do? Would I annoy him?
Would it be awkward?

01:13:40.417 --> 01:13:43.297
Tiamat Makes Closest Approach Tomorrow

01:13:41.057 --> 01:13:42.807
Or maybe...

01:13:44.127 --> 01:13:46.847
he'd be a bit glad to see me?

01:13:48.137 --> 01:13:52.307
The number you are trying to call
is not reachable...

01:13:53.057 --> 01:13:54.787
There's no way we could meet.

01:13:56.547 --> 01:13:56.997
But...

01:13:59.267 --> 01:14:01.457
...one thing is certain.

01:14:02.767 --> 01:14:06.437
If we see each other, we'll know.

01:14:07.527 --> 01:14:10.207
That you were the one who was inside me.

01:14:11.637 --> 01:14:14.817
That I was the one who was inside you.

01:14:14.837 --> 01:14:15.527
I'm sorry.

01:14:47.697 --> 01:14:48.417
Excuse me.

01:15:21.397 --> 01:15:25.487
That time three years ago,
before I got to know you...

01:15:29.277 --> 01:15:29.957
Taki-kun.

01:15:31.697 --> 01:15:32.437
Taki-kun.

01:15:34.897 --> 01:15:35.537
Taki-kun.

01:15:37.327 --> 01:15:38.687
Um... It's me.

01:15:41.647 --> 01:15:43.617
Don't you remember me?

01:15:45.237 --> 01:15:46.407
Who are you?

01:15:51.407 --> 01:15:52.327
I'm sorry.

01:16:00.567 --> 01:16:01.827
But he's Taki-kun.

01:16:03.207 --> 01:16:04.247
Weird girl.

01:16:13.867 --> 01:16:14.567
Hey!

01:16:16.087 --> 01:16:17.107
What's your name?

01:16:18.117 --> 01:16:18.787
Mitsuha!

01:16:19.697 --> 01:16:21.697
My name is Mitsuha!

01:16:28.887 --> 01:16:33.567
That time three years ago, you came...

01:16:34.807 --> 01:16:36.427
to see me!

01:16:47.567 --> 01:16:48.647
Taki-kun?

01:16:57.317 --> 01:16:59.077
Mitsuha!

01:17:00.287 --> 01:17:01.087
Taki-kun?

01:17:15.887 --> 01:17:17.377
Mitsuha!

01:17:18.057 --> 01:17:21.347
You're here, aren't you? Inside my body!

01:17:22.347 --> 01:17:23.157
Taki-kun!

01:17:24.397 --> 01:17:26.067
Taki-kun, where are you?

01:17:27.227 --> 01:17:27.957
It's Mitsuha.

01:17:28.817 --> 01:17:30.047
I can hear her, but...

01:17:31.697 --> 01:17:34.467
Taki-kun, where are you?

01:17:35.057 --> 01:17:36.017
Taki-kun!

01:17:49.287 --> 01:17:51.297
Taki-kun, are you...

01:17:52.897 --> 01:17:53.637
there?

01:18:19.077 --> 01:18:20.207
It's twilight - "kataware-doki."

01:18:35.877 --> 01:18:36.597
Mitsuha.

01:18:43.327 --> 01:18:44.177
Taki-kun.

01:18:45.937 --> 01:18:49.217
Taki-kun. It's really you.

01:18:53.607 --> 01:18:54.437
Taki-kun!

01:18:54.737 --> 01:18:56.467
I came to see you.

01:18:57.237 --> 01:19:01.047
It wasn't easy because
you were so far away.

01:19:02.207 --> 01:19:05.887
But how? At that moment, I...

01:19:06.257 --> 01:19:08.407
I drank your Kuchikamizake.

01:19:12.767 --> 01:19:14.597
You drank that?

01:19:16.047 --> 01:19:17.247
You idiot! Pervert!

01:19:18.257 --> 01:19:21.367
Oh yeah, and you touched my boobs!

01:19:21.407 --> 01:19:23.447
H-How? How do you know that?

01:19:23.487 --> 01:19:25.207
Yotsuha saw it.

01:19:25.207 --> 01:19:28.627
Oh! Sorry, I couldn't help it!
It was just once.

01:19:29.017 --> 01:19:30.227
Just once?

01:19:32.727 --> 01:19:34.387
Doesn't matter how many times! Jerk.

01:19:35.237 --> 01:19:35.827
Sorry.

01:19:36.647 --> 01:19:38.487
Oh, this...

01:19:39.317 --> 01:19:43.157
Oh. Really, Why'd you come see me
before I knew you?

01:19:43.807 --> 01:19:45.077
There's no way I'd recognize you.

01:19:45.887 --> 01:19:49.007
Here. I kept it for three years.

01:19:50.457 --> 01:19:51.917
Now you keep it.

01:19:53.647 --> 01:19:54.097
Yes.

01:20:02.887 --> 01:20:03.617
How is it?

01:20:04.967 --> 01:20:06.327
Not bad.

01:20:06.927 --> 01:20:08.197
You're lying!

01:20:08.207 --> 01:20:10.367
No, I... I'm sorry.

01:20:10.727 --> 01:20:12.467
You're really so...!

01:20:25.947 --> 01:20:29.157
Mitsuha, you still have
things to do. Listen.

01:20:32.727 --> 01:20:33.287
It's coming.

01:20:34.337 --> 01:20:36.577
Don't worry. You've still got time.

01:20:36.787 --> 01:20:38.547
Yes, I'll try.

01:20:41.027 --> 01:20:42.997
Kataware-doki is almost...

01:20:43.527 --> 01:20:44.067
over.

01:20:46.727 --> 01:20:50.177
Hey, Mitsuha. So we don't forget
when we wake up...

01:20:55.317 --> 01:20:58.167
Let's write our names
on each other. Here.

01:21:00.447 --> 01:21:00.867
Okay!

01:21:10.907 --> 01:21:11.507
Mitsuha?

01:21:14.467 --> 01:21:15.617
Hey, Mitsuha?

01:21:25.167 --> 01:21:26.337
I wanted to tell you.

01:21:28.727 --> 01:21:33.297
Wherever you are in the world,
I'll search for you.

01:21:37.217 --> 01:21:38.997
Your name is Mitsuha.

01:21:41.287 --> 01:21:43.057
It's okay. I remember.

01:21:43.747 --> 01:21:47.167
Mitsuha. Mitsuha. Mitsuha.
Your name is Mitsuha.

01:21:47.687 --> 01:21:48.657
Your name is...

01:21:59.637 --> 01:22:02.627
Who are you?

01:22:05.087 --> 01:22:07.607
Why did I come here?

01:22:08.847 --> 01:22:11.507
I came here to see her.

01:22:12.177 --> 01:22:15.397
To save her. I wanted her to be alive.

01:22:16.517 --> 01:22:19.717
Who was it? Who?
Who did I come to see?

01:22:21.567 --> 01:22:24.997
Someone dear to me. I don't want
to forget. I shouldn't forget!

01:22:26.817 --> 01:22:31.007
Who? Who? Who? Who?

01:22:31.827 --> 01:22:32.967
What's your name?

01:22:34.477 --> 01:22:36.477
{Sparkle}

01:22:34.487 --> 01:22:38.337
Caught in a never ending game

01:22:38.337 --> 01:22:42.287
Seems like the world's still trying to tame me

01:22:42.287 --> 01:22:44.657
If that's the way I will obey

01:22:46.097 --> 01:22:48.567
Beautifully struggle everyday

01:22:48.507 --> 01:22:51.487
Taki-kun. Taki-kun. Taki-kun. 

01:22:49.947 --> 01:22:52.517
Should we have a little kiss

01:22:51.957 --> 01:22:55.377
It's okay. I remember. I'll never forget!

01:22:53.827 --> 01:22:57.727
While seeing both of our hourglasses

01:22:56.197 --> 01:22:58.097
Taki-kun. Taki-kun.

01:22:57.737 --> 01:23:01.607
Let's make a plan to meet somewhere that is

01:22:58.647 --> 01:23:01.477
Your name is Taki-kun!

01:23:01.597 --> 01:23:04.087
Most far from "goodbye"

01:23:11.437 --> 01:23:13.427
I{*\fs120.942\c&HA0784D&\fax-0.542}T{*\fs121.882\c&H9D764C&\fax-0.535}O{*\fs122.824\c&H9B744A&\fax-0.527}M{*\fs123.764\c&H997249&\fax-0.519}O{*\fs124.706\c&H967048&\fax-0.512}R{*\fs125.648\c&H946E47&\fax-0.504}I {*\fs127.53\c&H8F6A44&\fax-0.489}S{*\fs128.47\c&H8D6843&\fax-0.481}U{*\fs129.412\c&H8A6642&\fax-0.474}B{*\fs130.352\c&H886440&\fax-0.466}S{*\fs131.294\c&H86623F&\fax-0.458}T{*\fs132.236\c&H83603E&\fax-0.451}A{*\fs133.176\c&H815E3D&\fax-0.443}T{*\fs134.118\c&H7F5C3B&\fax-0.435}I{*\fs135.058\c&H7C5A3A&\fax-0.428}ON

01:23:15.957 --> 01:23:17.187
Tessie!

01:23:17.747 --> 01:23:20.417
Mitsuha! Where have you been?

01:23:20.437 --> 01:23:22.597
He said sorry for breaking your bike.

01:23:20.887 --> 01:23:23.377
How I hated this lifeless world

01:23:22.757 --> 01:23:25.187
- Huh? Who did?
- I did.

01:23:24.867 --> 01:23:28.817
That's made up entirely of dictionary words that{How I hate these anime releases, built of nothing but lifeless literal translations}

01:23:26.687 --> 01:23:28.677
Explain everything to me later.

01:23:28.827 --> 01:23:31.177
I saw through my kaleidoscope

01:23:31.807 --> 01:23:35.007
On a monotonous August morn

01:23:33.477 --> 01:23:35.827
That's going to fall? Really?

01:23:36.117 --> 01:23:38.167
Yes! Saw it with my own eyes!

01:23:36.607 --> 01:23:38.917
When you appeared in front of me

01:23:38.437 --> 01:23:40.977
What? You saw it, huh?

01:23:40.387 --> 01:23:44.247
You acted shy but I didn't miss your grinning face like

01:23:41.127 --> 01:23:46.337
Then I guess we got no choice.
Now we're both criminals!

01:23:44.247 --> 01:23:47.307
If it's the textbook of this world of

01:23:47.277 --> 01:23:49.197
Broadcasting Room

01:23:48.057 --> 01:23:50.617
How to make your smile on your face

01:23:49.077 --> 01:23:50.767
What? I really have to do it?

01:23:51.047 --> 01:23:57.087
When the town's power goes out, the
equipment there should work on backup.

01:23:57.697 --> 01:24:00.807
Please, Saya-chin!
Repeat it as much as you can!

01:24:02.127 --> 01:24:03.187
You can do it!

01:24:03.957 --> 01:24:06.867
Oh, to heck with it!

01:24:07.307 --> 01:24:09.907
Finally, the time has come

01:24:11.327 --> 01:24:15.257
Everything up 'til yesterday was a prologue

01:24:13.297 --> 01:24:15.877
- Soon, you think?
- I've no idea!

01:24:15.257 --> 01:24:17.547
Skimming through the days of old

01:24:19.107 --> 01:24:21.747
It's my turn to bear the load

01:24:22.937 --> 01:24:25.377
My experience and my skill

01:24:26.387 --> 01:24:28.067
- What was that?
- What's that sound?

01:24:26.857 --> 01:24:30.287
And all the courage I had let start to mildew

01:24:28.307 --> 01:24:28.977
Hey, look!

01:24:30.677 --> 01:24:34.277
At an unprecedented speed, I will

01:24:34.607 --> 01:24:36.557
Dive right into you

01:24:37.967 --> 01:24:41.837
And when I dozed off into a lukewarm can of soda,

01:24:41.837 --> 01:24:45.737
I dreamed of a world so far from here that's not on the map

01:24:45.737 --> 01:24:49.597
Searching outside of the classroom window

01:24:49.597 --> 01:24:55.287
Or in a summer morning that's brought from the commuting train

01:24:55.407 --> 01:24:56.577
Hey, look!

01:25:06.517 --> 01:25:09.587
This is Itomori Town Hall.

01:25:10.727 --> 01:25:14.177
An explosion has occurred
at the substation.

01:25:14.927 --> 01:25:18.607
There is danger of further explosions
and forest fires.

01:25:19.447 --> 01:25:24.687
Residents in the following areas, please
evacuate to Itomori High School.

01:25:26.207 --> 01:25:29.807
Kadoiri District, Sakagami District,

01:25:31.397 --> 01:25:34.417
The broadcast isn't from here?
Who is it, then?

01:25:34.467 --> 01:25:35.457
Miyamori District...

01:25:37.317 --> 01:25:38.337
Oyazawa District...

01:25:40.337 --> 01:25:41.217
Let's go, Mitsuha!

01:25:43.487 --> 01:25:44.067
Tessie!

01:25:51.147 --> 01:25:53.537
Run, everyone! Forest fire!

01:25:53.567 --> 01:25:55.637
Forest fire! Please evacuate!

01:25:56.567 --> 01:25:57.727
Run! Fire!

01:25:57.827 --> 01:26:00.497
It's not safe here! Please evacuate!

01:26:02.127 --> 01:26:04.437
We don't have enough time! Mitsuha!

01:26:06.497 --> 01:26:07.047
What's wrong?

01:26:08.467 --> 01:26:12.357
His name... I can't remember his name.

01:26:15.127 --> 01:26:18.357
Look, I don't know.
You started all this!

01:26:19.247 --> 01:26:21.717
We can't evacuate everyone by ourselves!

01:26:22.417 --> 01:26:24.607
Go persuade your father!

01:26:33.007 --> 01:26:36.017
Everyone run! Go to the high school!

01:26:39.077 --> 01:26:40.197
Oh, Mitsuha-chan.

01:26:43.667 --> 01:26:47.057
There's no way it's terrorist attack in a place like here’
What's Chubu Electric saying?

01:26:47.077 --> 01:26:48.247
They're still checking!

01:26:48.687 --> 01:26:51.717
No forest fire yet? Are you sure?

01:26:52.257 --> 01:26:52.657
Okay!

01:26:54.487 --> 01:26:58.097
Stop this broadcast!
Figure out where it's coming from!

01:26:58.497 --> 01:27:00.967
The Takayama sensor station called!

01:27:02.267 --> 01:27:03.247
The high school?

01:27:04.117 --> 01:27:09.907
Again, residents in the following areas,
evacuate to Itomori High School. ...Oh!

01:27:10.197 --> 01:27:12.487
What are you doing? Turn that off!

01:27:14.987 --> 01:27:15.737
Saya-chin!

01:27:15.947 --> 01:27:17.107
Oh no.

01:27:20.737 --> 01:27:23.207
What have you done, Natori!

01:27:26.997 --> 01:27:29.477
This is Itomori Town Hall.

01:27:31.037 --> 01:27:34.127
We are currently
checking on the accident.

01:27:35.267 --> 01:27:40.307
Please don't panic and stay
where you are for further notice.

01:27:40.417 --> 01:27:41.427
Stay put, they said.

01:27:42.127 --> 01:27:44.197
- What's going on?
- So we stay put?

01:27:45.347 --> 01:27:50.197
Come on, you should all evacuate!
The high school is the shelter!

01:27:50.607 --> 01:27:51.327
Katsuhiko!

01:27:54.897 --> 01:27:57.077
What are you doing?

01:28:00.487 --> 01:28:01.607
I'm sorry, Mitsuha.

01:28:03.487 --> 01:28:04.307
It's over.

01:28:07.157 --> 01:28:10.527
It's really splitting apart!

01:28:17.367 --> 01:28:18.887
- Look at that!
- Wow!

01:28:19.107 --> 01:28:21.937
Please look! The comet has split in two

01:28:22.257 --> 01:28:24.007
and meteors are falling!

01:28:24.127 --> 01:28:26.657
Nobody predicted this.

01:28:26.837 --> 01:28:28.607
We have a mystical view here.

01:28:28.627 --> 01:28:30.577
So the comet's nucleus split?

01:28:30.577 --> 01:28:31.967
Did tidal forces affect...

01:28:32.017 --> 01:28:36.847
The comet isn't within the Roche limit
so the nucleus itself must have...

01:28:36.927 --> 01:28:42.307
In the past; Comet Shoemaker-Levy 9
broke and collided with Jupiter in 1994.

01:28:42.367 --> 01:28:43.697
At least 27 fragments...

01:28:43.937 --> 01:28:45.477
I'm going to go look!

01:28:46.367 --> 01:28:49.807
They will probably melt
before reaching the ground

01:28:50.087 --> 01:28:54.547
and the probability of a meteor crashing
into a residential area is small...

01:28:54.547 --> 01:28:56.147
To predict the trajectory...

01:28:56.287 --> 01:28:59.427
To be witnessing such a magnificent
celestial event, and...

01:28:59.717 --> 01:29:02.467
That we're witnessing this live

01:29:02.607 --> 01:29:06.807
is extremely fortunate
for those of us living in this age.

01:29:09.637 --> 01:29:12.487
Hey. Who are you?

01:29:16.817 --> 01:29:18.407
Who? Who?

01:29:19.107 --> 01:29:20.167
